Interpretation columns: market_implied = how much the closing market penalises the backup relative to the no-QB nfelo rating line;
realized_vs_noQB = points the backup team actually lost vs that line; nfelo538_adj = penalty nfelo's 538-style QB adj applied;
resid_after_538 = penalty still unexplained after nfelo's adj (what a top-up would need to be); resid_vs_market = unexplained after the market.

